Subject: [PATCH] V2j: shared-moment aggregation of marginal Gram entries (22nd
 pair)

V2i's piece value genPieceWith is linear in the moment oracle and reads it
only at genKeys (duplicate-free, computed by mirroring stateVal/placeVal).
genPieceWith_eq_keys collapses it to Sum_s coeff(s) * moment(s); aggEntryVal
collects coefficients per key across a weighted list of generator pairs and
evaluates each distinct moment once per piece, with aggEntryVal_eq and
jT_weighted_eq_agg proving equality with V2i's genEntryVal and J_T.
Kernel demonstration: V2i's certified gpPP_6_3 recomputed from 19 moments
(115 oracle queries directly), the four V2i entries from 21 shared keys, and
J_T[P2,P2] on synthetic data. Specification: Exploratory/V2j/SPEC.md.

